@title A device tag over 60 characters is refused and the box keeps focus
@area Schematic
@sizes 1366x768

# SB-04 / SB-02: the long tag used to be taken (its label then vanished); the refusal now shows in the rename box.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
click 353 228
wait 5
key F2
wait 5
text K1111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111111
key Enter
wait 5
shot too-long
expect "at most 60"
text 7
wait 5
shot still-typing
check_layout
